 <limengzhe@limengzhedeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:40:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: unify room member names and collapse redundant progress
 updates

Use one display-name policy across room controls and replies, remove the duplicate native-history stream, and keep the latest reply visible with earlier updates collapsed. Preserve original records, delivery grouping and no-replay behavior; verified with 33 renderer tests and typecheck.
